{"obsah":"<p>Vlasta, Martin Šimůnek and Michal Budský accepted an invitation to perform at the opening of an exhibition of cycling-related art. We set up our trailer with the main obstacles at the main entrance and threw ourselves into our show. It was great to meet several former Trial riders and bikers there, who motivated us to perform even better. The exhibition was also very interesting and creative, as were the gallery spaces themselves, which we definitely recommend visiting.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F441077588_832839572231066_4321998892271351862_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F441077588_832839572231066_4321998892271351862_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246092\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F441080114_832838852231138_1620110092143057036_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F441080114_832838852231138_1620110092143057036_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246091\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FDSC6684-2_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FDSC6684-2_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246093\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"h